      "content": "\"consensus among experts\" is a pretty big claim. i've been seeing a lot of reports lately from different analysts saying the data is actually pretty mixed and that some of these metrics are just way too soft to prove a real link to profit. can you point to the specific research that shows this is an established consensus?",
